---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-10 md:gap-12 lg:gap-14 xl:gap-16 max-w-6xl mt-14 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center">
                Local Focus
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-600 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center font-medium px-auto">
                Warehouses in Chennai, Bengaluru, Hosur & Madurai
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <p class="w-full lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-800 text-left font-medium px-auto pb-1.5">
                We deeply understand land markets in these cities:
            </p>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mt-3 md:mt-4 lg:mt-5 xl:mt-6 mb-6 md:mb-8 lg:mb-10 xl:mb-12">
                <div class="w-[10%]">
                </div>
                <div class="w-[60%] col-center">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/chennailandscape.webp" alt="chennai" width={850} height={175} class="w-[90%]" />
                    <div class="w-full col-center shadow-xs md:shadow-sm lg:shadow-md xl:shadow-lg rounded-xl">
                        <div class="w-full rounded-t-xl bg-linear-to-r from-[var(--primary-color)] to-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] px-4 py-1.5">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-bold text-white text-center">
                                Chennai & Surrounding Corridors
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-white rounded-b-xl">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium text-center text-gray-800 px-4 py-1.5">
                                Focus on ports, SEZs, industrial zones; balancing coastal regulation, land cost and connectivity.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[30%]">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 my-6 md:my-8 lg:my-10 xl:my-12">
                <div class="w-[30%]"></div>
                <div class="w-[60%] col-center">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/bengalurulandscape.webp" alt="bengaluru" width={850} height={175} class="w-[90%]" />
                    <div class="w-full col-center shadow-xs md:shadow-sm lg:shadow-md xl:shadow-lg rounded-xl">
                        <div class="w-full rounded-t-xl bg-linear-to-r from-[var(--primary-color)] to-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] px-4 py-1.5">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-bold text-white text-center">
                                Bengaluru / Devanhalli
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-white rounded-b-xl">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium text-center text-gray-800 px-4 py-1.5">
                                Proximity to airport, tech hubs, and rising warehousing demand; challenge of land scarcity & regulatory hurdles.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[10%]"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 my-6 md:my-8 lg:my-10 xl:my-12">
                <div class="w-[10%]">
                </div>
                <div class="w-[60%] col-center">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/hosurlandscape.webp" alt="hosur" width={850} height={175} class="w-[90%]" />
                    <div class="w-full col-center shadow-xs md:shadow-sm lg:shadow-md xl:shadow-lg rounded-xl">
                        <div class="w-full rounded-t-xl bg-linear-to-r from-[var(--primary-color)] to-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] px-4 py-1.5">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-bold text-white text-center">
                                Hosur
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-white rounded-b-xl">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium text-center text-gray-800 px-4 py-1.5">
                                Excellent for manufacturing, relatively lower land cost, strong road connectivity to Tamil Nadu and Karnataka.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[30%]">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5 my-6 md:my-8 lg:my-10 xl:my-12">
                <div class="w-[30%]"></div>
                <div class="w-[60%] col-center">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/madurailandscape.webp" alt="madurai" width={850} height={175} class="w-[90%]" />
                    <div class="w-full col-center shadow-xs md:shadow-sm lg:shadow-md xl:shadow-lg rounded-xl">
                        <div class="w-full rounded-t-xl bg-linear-to-r from-[var(--primary-color)] to-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] px-4 py-1.5">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-bold text-white text-center">
                                Madurai
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-white rounded-b-xl">
                            <p class="lg:text-lg font-medium text-center text-gray-800 px-4 py-1.5">
                                Growing demand in South Tamil Nadu; emerging infrastructure; advantage of local labour & logistic access to southern states.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[10%]"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>